WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.875
<b>In the previous verse,</b>

2
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:37.958
<b>Lord Krishna explained the importance </b>
<b>of firm faith for spiritual knowledge,</b>

3
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:44.375
<b>and now here, he is describing the </b>
<b>exact opposite situation,</b>

4
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.666
<b>where there is a lack of faith.</b>

5
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:56.208
<b>Lord Krishna is describing three situations.</b>

6
00:00:56.208 --> 00:01:01.208
<b>In this verse, he says that those who </b>
<b>do not have the right knowledge,</b>

7
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:04.708
<b>or do not have faith in spiritual knowledge,</b>

8
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:08.083
<b>or have many doubts about it,</b>

9
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:10.666
<b>ultimately meet with downfall.</b>

10
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:15.458
<b>And one who is full of doubt</b>
<b>has neither happiness in this world</b>

11
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:16.958
<b>nor in the hereafter.</b>

12
00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:20.875
<b>Understand these three situations and people.</b>

13
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.791
<b>First, the ignorant people:</b>

14
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:28.708
<b>These people are unaware of the knowledge</b>
<b>of spirituality and scriptures.</b>

15
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:35.333
<b>And due to this lack of knowledge, they are </b>
<b>unable to lead a purposeful and peaceful life.</b>

16
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.958
<b>Second, the faithless people:</b>

17
00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:43.416
<b>These people are intelligent, they certainly </b>
<b>have awareness of spiritual knowledge,</b>

18
00:01:43.416 --> 00:01:47.458
<b>but they do not believe in that knowledge.</b>

19
00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:50.125
<b>Third, the skeptical people:</b>

20
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:55.000
<b>These people always remain in doubt </b>
<b>regarding spiritual knowledge.</b>

21
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:04.166
<b>They can never be assured whether spirituality</b>
<b>will be able to lead them to their goals or not.</b>

22
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:08.291
<b>Lord Krishna says that all three are </b>
<b>heading towards downfall.</b>

23
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:14.166
<b>But here, the most dire situation is of those</b>
<b>who always remain skeptical,</b>

24
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:16.458
<b>surrounded by doubts.</b>

25
00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:18.833
<b>The ignorant can be given knowledge.</b>

26
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:23.125
<b>In the faithless, one day, faith can</b>
<b>awaken due to knowledge.</b>

27
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.000
<b>But</b>

28
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.916
<b>one who is skeptical and harbors doubts,</b>

29
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:31.875
<b>neither knowledge nor faith will</b>
<b>be fully effective for them.</b>

30
00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:35.458
<b>They will remain stuck sometimes </b>
<b>moving forward, sometimes backward,</b>

31
00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:39.625
<b>like Trishanku (Trapped between two worlds).</b>

32
00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:41.708
<b>And the second important thing is that </b>

33
00:02:41.708 --> 00:02:46.083
<b>a skeptic will always remain distressed in this life</b>

34
00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:49.750
<b>because he is stuck between right and wrong,</b>

35
00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.083
<b>he is unable to take any direction,</b>

36
00:02:52.083 --> 00:02:57.125
<b>neither to fully embrace </b>
<b>spirituality nor to give it up.</b>

37
00:02:57.125 --> 00:03:01.000
<b>Such a person will always remain </b>
<b>far from happiness and peace.</b>

38
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.125
<b>And when this life ends in this very doubt,</b>

39
00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:07.875
<b>then in the next life too, only sorrow</b>
<b>and restlessness will be obtained.</b>

40
00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:15.041
<b>If you look, Krishna is once again </b>
<b>indirectly emphasizing the importance of faith.</b>

41
00:03:15.041 --> 00:03:19.458
<b>Without complete faith and trust in the </b>
<b>knowledge given by the scriptures and the guru,</b>

42
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:22.500
<b>spiritual progress can never happen.</b>

43
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.583
<b>Therefore, we will have to develop faith,</b>

44
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:27.958
<b>and then with the knowledge of the right guru,</b>

45
00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:31.791
<b>we too can attain peace and liberation.</b>

46
00:03:36.375 --> 00:03:45.250
<b>Self-doubt can become a very big obstacle in life.</b>

47
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.583
<b>Just think,</b>

48
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:51.541
<b>you have knowledge in front of you,</b>

49
00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:53.958
<b>the path to progress is also there,</b>

50
00:03:53.958 --> 00:03:55.291
<b>but</b>

51
00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:58.833
<b>you do not acquire that knowledge</b>

52
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:04.208
<b>because you doubt that the </b>
<b>knowledge will not work.</b>

53
00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:09.375
<b>You are unable to move forward </b>
<b>on that path of progress because</b>

54
00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:17.000
<b>you suspect that the path may lead to failure.</b>

55
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.791
<b>This is such an irony,</b>

56
00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:22.708
<b>as if on a deserted island,</b>

57
00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:29.333
<b>in front of a person, a boat is also tied, </b>
<b>its oar is also kept,</b>

58
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:35.750
<b>but due to doubt, that person never </b>
<b>launches that boat into the sea.</b>

59
00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.583
<b>He will never be able to become free, right?</b>

60
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:42.458
<b>Self-confidence is extremely important in life</b>

61
00:04:42.458 --> 00:04:50.375
<b>because if there is no self-confidence, it will have</b>
<b>the opposite effect on every aspect of life.</b>

62
00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:56.750
<b>And self-confidence does not mean that </b>
<b>you will never face failure in life.</b>

63
00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:04.958
<b>Failure is a part of life, but even there, </b>
<b>self-confidence will save you in two ways:</b>

64
00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:06.958
<b>First -</b>

65
00:05:06.958 --> 00:05:09.083
<b>This time there was failure,</b>

66
00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:15.166
<b>but it is possible that with effort, success </b>
<b>may be achieved next time.</b>

67
00:05:15.166 --> 00:05:16.291
<b>Second -</b>

68
00:05:16.291 --> 00:05:18.333
<b>  Failure was certainly met,</b>

69
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:22.083
<b>but there is no lack of ability in me.</b>

70
00:05:22.083 --> 00:05:26.875
<b>Now it has become known that </b>
<b>this path was not for me,</b>

71
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:30.875
<b>so I have to change the path and </b>
<b>walk in a new direction.</b>

72
00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:38.666
<b>One who has self-confidence will keep trying </b>
<b>on the same path or find a new path.</b>

73
00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:39.916
<b>But</b>

74
00:05:39.916 --> 00:05:47.208
<b>one who has self-doubt will sit down in despair.</b>

75
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:49.041
<b>Now you only tell me,</b>

76
00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:52.916
<b>if someone starts fearing to even walk,</b>

77
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:58.750
<b>then the possibility of progress </b>
<b>will become zero, right?</b>

78
00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.833
<b>Do not get stuck on the island of doubt.</b>

79
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:07.125
<b>The boat is in front of you, the oar is also kept.</b>

80
00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:10.666
<b>You just have to set out into the sea.</b>

81
00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:21.625
<b>Having faith in any work is extremely important.</b>

82
00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:23.291
<b>In society,</b>

83
00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:28.583
<b>there are many types of religious </b>
<b>and spiritual programs.</b>

84
00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:32.416
<b>All communities have their own rituals.</b>

85
00:06:32.416 --> 00:06:34.541
<b>Many people participate in them.</b>

86
00:06:34.541 --> 00:06:40.166
<b>And among these participants,</b>
<b>there are all kinds of people:</b>

87
00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:43.041
<b>Some who have true faith.</b>

88
00:06:43.041 --> 00:06:51.708
<b> Some who do it without faith, just as </b>
<b>a physical or social activity.</b>

89
00:06:51.708 --> 00:07:00.958
<b>At the same time, some have deep doubts </b>
<b>about these rituals and religious programs;</b>

90
00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:04.541
<b>they consider them a farce.</b>

91
00:07:04.541 --> 00:07:12.166
<b>Here too, if the support of knowledge is taken,</b>
<b>the situation can change.</b>

92
00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:21.416
<b>One who has true faith in spirituality will </b>
<b>never criticize others, he will help them.</b>

93
00:07:21.416 --> 00:07:27.875
<b>So if some people still have </b>
<b>doubts, it doesn't matter. </b>

94
00:07:27.875 --> 00:07:34.333
<b>Considering them as your own self, </b>
<b>remain their well-wisher,</b>

95
00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:38.458
<b>help them when needed.</b>

96
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:41.083
<b>Through this selfless behavior of yours,</b>

97
00:07:41.083 --> 00:07:45.041
<b>they too will begin to understand</b>
<b>the power of spirituality.</b>

98
00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:48.500
<b>They will be inspired towards this path.</b>

99
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.833
<b>In this verse,</b>

100
00:07:57.833 --> 00:08:03.916
<b>the importance of the impact </b>
<b>of faith and doubt is clear.</b>

101
00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:05.708
<b>Just think,</b>

102
00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:12.916
<b> if entrepreneurs do not have faith </b>
<b>while stepping into a new field,</b>

103
00:08:12.916 --> 00:08:17.083
<b>can they take advantage of new opportunities?</b>

104
00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:20.916
<b>On the other hand, if there</b>
<b>is deep doubt in the mind,</b>

105
00:08:20.916 --> 00:08:27.625
<b>even in the most golden opportunity, that </b>
<b>entrepreneur will not be able to move forward.</b>

106
00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:30.875
<b>This knowledge is not limited </b>
<b>only to entrepreneurs</b>

107
00:08:30.875 --> 00:08:32.041
<b>but</b>

108
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:38.833
<b>is also important for people working in </b>
<b>every professional organization.</b>

109
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:43.541
<b>A senior executive, while having faith in his plan,</b>

110
00:08:43.541 --> 00:08:50.375
<b>can remove the doubts of his colleagues </b>
<b>and instill confidence in them as well.</b>

111
00:08:50.375 --> 00:08:57.500
<b>But if that same senior executive is </b>
<b>struggling with personal doubts,</b>

112
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:03.791
<b>he will certainly block the new thinking </b>
<b>and new suggestions of others as well.</b>

113
00:09:03.791 --> 00:09:07.708
<b>Gradually, people working with him</b>

114
00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:14.541
<b>will also start getting frustrated due to </b>
<b>their suggestions being rejected.</b>

115
00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:20.291
<b>The doubt of a senior executive</b>
<b>can affect everyone.</b>

116
00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:26.958
<b>Therefore, reduce doubt and increase faith.</b>

117
00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:29.458
<b>There are many ways to do this:</b>

118
00:09:29.458 --> 00:09:38.166
<b>Encourage yourself and others even on</b>
<b>the achievement of small goals.</b>

119
00:09:38.166 --> 00:09:44.125
<b>When doubt starts to arise, </b>
<b>remember past successes.</b>

120
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:46.250
<b>A little rest is also necessary – </b>

121
00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:50.583
<b>sometimes fatigue weakens self-confidence.</b>

122
00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:52.791
<b>And yes,</b>

123
00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:54.583
<b>remember</b>

124
00:09:54.583 --> 00:09:59.875
<b>that self-confidence and doubt are </b>
<b>both matters of the mind.</b>

125
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:04.625
<b>So it is extremely important to </b>
<b>keep the mind healthy.</b>

126
00:10:04.625 --> 00:10:06.333
<b>Therefore,</b>

127
00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:10.958
<b>never let go of the support of spirituality.</b>

